OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fvery warm evening with plenty of late
OL,7,Fsunshine. Remaining dry overnight with
OL,8,Fplenty of clear spells. Remaining warm
OL,9,Fmaking it rather uncomfortable for
OL,10,Fsleeping.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA warm and sunny start, but
OL,13,Fcloud tending to increase throughout
OL,14,Fthe day making the sunshine hazy. A
OL,15,Ffew showers also possibly developing
OL,16,Fcome the afternoon. Feeling very warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
